1
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,735
<font color="white">I am coming to you now.</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:27,444 --> 00:00:30,196
<font color="white">Please come meet me, my dear husband.</font><font color="white"></font>

3
00:00:34,909 --> 00:00:36,036
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:36,870 --> 00:00:37,829
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:39,122 --> 00:00:39,956
<font color="white">Oh, good heavens.</font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:42,250
<font color="white">What are you doing over there?</font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:42,333 --> 00:00:43,293
<font color="white">It's dangerous!</font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:43,376 --> 00:00:45,086
<font color="white">I said it's dangerous!</font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:47,756
<font color="white">Madam!</font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:49,716 --> 00:00:51,176
<font color="white">Come here! Quickly!</font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:56,681
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:58,641 --> 00:00:59,476
<font color="white">Let's go.</font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:00,852 --> 00:01:01,770
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:10,278 --> 00:01:11,154
<font color="white">No, wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:41,518 --> 00:01:42,519
<font color="white">Well, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

16
00:02:02,831 --> 00:02:04,249
<font color="white">"An Hui-yeon."</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:02:15,718 --> 00:02:21,349
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:02:37,657 --> 00:02:39,325
<font color="white">Because I wish to hold…</font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:02:43,663 --> 00:02:46,166
<font color="white">a child that bears your likeness</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in my arms.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

20
00:02:48,209 --> 00:02:49,460
<font color="white">Do you still…</font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:02:53,006 --> 00:02:55,675
<font color="white">hold me in your heart?</font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:03:01,598 --> 00:03:02,432
<font color="white">Do you?</font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:03:05,435 --> 00:03:06,436
<font color="white">Is that it?</font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:03:10,607 --> 00:03:11,482
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:03:12,233 --> 00:03:13,860
<font color="white">Madam, it is Gye-hwa.</font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:03:14,569 --> 00:03:16,070
<font color="white">Pardon the intrusion.</font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:03:32,629 --> 00:03:33,588
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:03:33,671 --> 00:03:36,633
<font color="white">The Lady of the First Rank</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has sent more medicinal herbs.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

29
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:40,178
<font color="white">What shall we send in return?</font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:03:40,261 --> 00:03:42,055
<font color="white">About the Left State Councilor's house.</font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:03:43,389 --> 00:03:46,434
<font color="white">You know his eldest son suddenly died</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a few years ago, do you not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

32
00:03:47,477 --> 00:03:49,395
<font color="white">As it happens, I crossed paths</font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:52,023
<font color="white">with his young widow on my way to Hanyang.</font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:03:52,649 --> 00:03:53,900
<font color="white">I saw her only briefly,</font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:03:57,904 --> 00:04:01,199
<font color="white">yet she had a certain allure</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that draws a man in.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

36
00:04:02,825 --> 00:04:03,785
<font color="white">As though</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:04:04,369 --> 00:04:07,121
<font color="white">she were concealing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a deep sensuality beneath the surface.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

38
00:04:07,205 --> 00:04:08,331
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:04:09,832 --> 00:04:12,210
<font color="white">You scoffed at the matter of So-ok,</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:04:12,293 --> 00:04:15,630
<font color="white">yet at the mention of a widow,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your eyes fairly light up.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

41
00:04:19,968 --> 00:04:21,511
<font color="white">It is only natural, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:04:22,553 --> 00:04:25,056
<font color="white">A woman of fate in full bloom</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:04:25,848 --> 00:04:28,810
<font color="white">is far more diverting</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">than some downy little girl.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

44
00:04:30,979 --> 00:04:32,605
<font color="white">By your words alone,</font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:04:32,689 --> 00:04:35,483
<font color="white">one would think you have already</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">held her in your arms.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

46
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:52,250
<font color="white">A widow like her?</font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:04:56,838 --> 00:04:58,381
<font color="white">I could easily have her</font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:04:58,965 --> 00:05:00,591
<font color="white">within the month.</font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:05:01,551 --> 00:05:04,345
<font color="white">She has remained untouched</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for more than 20 years.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

50
00:05:05,388 --> 00:05:07,849
<font color="white">Are you saying you could so easily conquer</font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:05:08,766 --> 00:05:11,644
<font color="white">a woman so fiercely protective</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of her chastity?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

52
00:05:12,937 --> 00:05:14,063
<font color="white">What is it</font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:05:14,147 --> 00:05:15,523
<font color="white">you wish to see?</font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:05:16,274 --> 00:05:17,525
<font color="white">Whatever do you mean?</font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:05:18,651 --> 00:05:21,195
<font color="white">I merely fear</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you may bring ruin upon yourself</font><font color="white"></font></font>

56
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:23,406
<font color="white">meddling with such a woman.</font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:05:23,489 --> 00:05:26,075
<font color="white">She is the Left State Councilor's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">daughter-in-law, after all.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

58
00:05:31,205 --> 00:05:33,041
<font color="white">Let us forget the matter of So-ok,</font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:05:33,833 --> 00:05:36,544
<font color="white">and you should put aside</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">these idle amusements as well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

60
00:05:37,128 --> 00:05:38,046
<font color="white">Idle amusements?</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:05:39,630 --> 00:05:41,049
<font color="white">Could it be that</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:05:42,717 --> 00:05:44,469
<font color="white">you are jealous?</font><font color="white"></font>

63
00:05:44,552 --> 00:05:46,637
<font color="white">I spoke only out of concern,</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:05:47,722 --> 00:05:49,307
<font color="white">yet that is how you took it?</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:05:49,891 --> 00:05:50,808
<font color="white">Indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:05:51,309 --> 00:05:53,603
<font color="white">I had meant to amuse myself a bit,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but you bid me stop.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

67
00:05:54,437 --> 00:05:55,521
<font color="white">Now I find myself</font><font color="white"></font>

68
00:05:57,106 --> 00:05:58,941
<font color="white">all the more intrigued.</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:06:00,193 --> 00:06:01,069
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:06:04,113 --> 00:06:05,740
<font color="white">Are you truly saying</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:06:06,532 --> 00:06:08,910
<font color="white">-you would pursue her even at such risk?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Why?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

72
00:06:09,952 --> 00:06:11,079
<font color="white">Do you doubt me?</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:06:11,954 --> 00:06:13,539
<font color="white">What will you do if I succeed?</font><font color="white"></font>

74
00:06:13,623 --> 00:06:16,000
<font color="white">I plainly warned you against it,</font><font color="white"></font>

75
00:06:16,084 --> 00:06:17,960
<font color="white">yet if you insist upon seeing it through…</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:06:21,964 --> 00:06:23,591
<font color="white">then I shall reward you.</font><font color="white"></font>

77
00:06:24,342 --> 00:06:27,428
<font color="white">Whatever you desire.</font><font color="white"></font>

78
00:06:30,098 --> 00:06:31,099
<font color="white">Whatever</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:06:32,725 --> 00:06:33,851
<font color="white">I desire?</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:06:46,864 --> 00:06:49,200
<font color="white">The only thing I desire is you.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:06:50,326 --> 00:06:51,369
<font color="white">Surely you know</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:06:52,161 --> 00:06:53,913
<font color="white">that I have waited over a decade.</font><font color="white"></font>

83
00:06:57,583 --> 00:06:58,918
<font color="white">Then can you</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:06:59,001 --> 00:07:02,964
<font color="white">write a heartfelt account</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the sound of that widow's door opening</font><font color="white"></font></font>

85
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,633
<font color="white">after 20 long years?</font><font color="white"></font>

86
00:07:07,844 --> 00:07:10,888
<font color="white">Can you prove it to me in writing?</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:07:21,816 --> 00:07:22,650
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

88
00:07:27,613 --> 00:07:29,115
<font color="white">I could even stand before you</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:07:30,491 --> 00:07:32,493
<font color="white">and read it aloud.</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:07:35,288 --> 00:07:36,664
<font color="white">And if you fail,</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:07:37,999 --> 00:07:39,834
<font color="white">what will you give me?</font><font color="white"></font>

92
00:07:43,337 --> 00:07:44,672
<font color="white">As you wish,</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:07:46,549 --> 00:07:48,926
<font color="white">I shall see that So-ok bears a child.</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:07:50,094 --> 00:07:52,305
<font color="white">Then we are agreed?</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:07:52,889 --> 00:07:53,890
<font color="white">We are…</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:07:56,225 --> 00:07:57,393
<font color="white">agreed.</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:08:05,693 --> 00:08:08,029
<font color="white">-We'll finish early, won't we?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes, it's almost done.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

98
00:08:16,412 --> 00:08:17,914
<font color="white">Oh, I heard you already!</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:08:18,581 --> 00:08:21,292
<font color="white">Damn it. She gets boiled meat?</font><font color="white"></font>

100
00:08:21,375 --> 00:08:24,462
<font color="white">And nothing for the maid</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who isn't pregnant. How unfair!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

101
00:08:25,087 --> 00:08:27,965
<font color="white">-I'm dying for a bite of meat myself.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Eun-sil!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

102
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:29,467
<font color="white">Eun-sil!</font><font color="white"></font>

103
00:08:30,092 --> 00:08:32,094
<font color="white">We are leaving shortly!</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:08:32,178 --> 00:08:33,596
<font color="white">All right, I heard you!</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:08:41,354 --> 00:08:42,772
<font color="white">Oh, it's…</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:08:43,356 --> 00:08:44,607
<font color="white">It's nice to meet you.</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:08:44,690 --> 00:08:46,400
<font color="white">Is your name Eun-sil?</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:08:46,484 --> 00:08:48,194
<font color="white">That's a nice name.</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:08:48,277 --> 00:08:50,238
<font color="white">And your face is even nicer.</font><font color="white"></font>

110
00:08:50,321 --> 00:08:51,447
<font color="white">Oh, my.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:08:52,532 --> 00:08:54,951
<font color="white">What you have down there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is rather nice too.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

112
00:08:57,203 --> 00:08:58,454
<font color="white">Yes, very nice.</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:09:03,668 --> 00:09:05,461
<font color="white">Get away from me, you filthy bum!</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:09:05,545 --> 00:09:06,712
<font color="white">No, wait…</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:09:06,796 --> 00:09:08,548
<font color="white">Wait! Listen.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:09:08,631 --> 00:09:10,508
<font color="white">Are you craving meat?</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:09:16,514 --> 00:09:17,515
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:09:18,933 --> 00:09:20,226
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:09:22,019 --> 00:09:24,772
<font color="white">It seems she's craving meat. Good grief.</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:09:25,856 --> 00:09:26,899
<font color="white">Meat?</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:09:26,983 --> 00:09:27,817
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:30,319
<font color="white">You don't say.</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:09:30,403 --> 00:09:32,530
<font color="white">Meat while in mourning?</font><font color="white"></font>

124
00:09:32,613 --> 00:09:33,531
<font color="white">I meant, Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:09:34,782 --> 00:09:35,658
<font color="white">The lady's maid.</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:09:37,994 --> 00:09:39,495
<font color="white">-"Eun-sil"?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

127
00:09:39,579 --> 00:09:41,706
<font color="white">-You have learned her name already?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

128
00:09:43,708 --> 00:09:46,127
<font color="white">Thanks to you, my splendid master,</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:09:46,210 --> 00:09:48,879
<font color="white">I have tasted beef, pork,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">every kind of meat there is.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

130
00:09:48,963 --> 00:09:52,967
<font color="white">But other lowborn folk could never</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even hope to get a bite of meat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

131
00:09:56,345 --> 00:09:57,179
<font color="white">Right?</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:10:00,266 --> 00:10:02,768
<font color="white">Find out where that girl Eun-sil has gone.</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:10:02,852 --> 00:10:03,686
<font color="white">Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:10:33,424 --> 00:10:34,300
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:10:45,811 --> 00:10:46,812
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:10:51,233 --> 00:10:52,151
<font color="white">"I cannot…</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:10:53,778 --> 00:10:55,404
<font color="white">get you out of my mind, my lady."</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:10:56,781 --> 00:10:58,282
<font color="white">How's that, Chil-seong?</font><font color="white"></font>

139
00:10:58,366 --> 00:10:59,283
<font color="white">Good.</font><font color="white"></font>

140
00:10:59,367 --> 00:11:01,369
<font color="white">No, that won't do.</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:04,330
<font color="white">"I cannot forget the moment</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:11:04,955 --> 00:11:05,915
<font color="white">I first</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:11:06,874 --> 00:11:07,917
<font color="white">laid eyes upon you."</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:11:08,417 --> 00:11:09,377
<font color="white">Isn't that better?</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:11:09,460 --> 00:11:10,878
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:11:12,213 --> 00:11:13,047
<font color="white">All right.</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:11:19,428 --> 00:11:22,056
<font color="white">Hey, you fool. Keep still.</font><font color="white"></font>

148
00:11:22,139 --> 00:11:23,974
<font color="white">Now I have ruined it.</font><font color="white"></font>

149
00:11:25,434 --> 00:11:26,268
<font color="white">Again.</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:49,834 --> 00:11:51,001
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:51,502 --> 00:11:54,004
<font color="white">Good heavens, look who it is!</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:54,672 --> 00:11:56,298
<font color="white">It has been far too long.</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:56,382 --> 00:11:57,258
<font color="white">Who might you be?</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:57,341 --> 00:12:00,386
<font color="white">I don't know from which family you come,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but I don't believe we have met.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

155
00:12:00,469 --> 00:12:02,096
<font color="white">Do you not remember me?</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:12:02,179 --> 00:12:05,099
<font color="white">I am brother-in-law to Minister Yoo.</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:12:05,182 --> 00:12:07,393
<font color="white">My name is Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

158
00:12:07,977 --> 00:12:10,521
<font color="white">I thought I had seen you before</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and wished to pay my respects.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

159
00:12:10,604 --> 00:12:13,065
<font color="white">Forgive me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">if I have made you uncomfortable.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

160
00:12:13,149 --> 00:12:15,109
<font color="white">I do live near Minister Yoo's residence,</font><font color="white"></font>

161
00:12:15,192 --> 00:12:18,487
<font color="white">so perhaps</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">we have seen each other in passing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

162
00:12:19,155 --> 00:12:22,616
<font color="white">Oh, are you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">his wife's younger brother then?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

163
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:24,452
<font color="white">Her cousin, in fact.</font><font color="white"></font>

164
00:12:34,086 --> 00:12:37,423
<font color="white">I shall pay you a visit with her soon.</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:12:37,506 --> 00:12:38,674
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:12:41,844 --> 00:12:42,678
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

167
00:12:44,305 --> 00:12:45,890
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

168
00:12:46,474 --> 00:12:47,475
<font color="white">Go.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:48,058 --> 00:12:49,143
<font color="white">-Take this.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-What is it?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

170
00:12:49,226 --> 00:12:50,186
<font color="white">A letter.</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:50,269 --> 00:12:52,104
<font color="white">-You can read and write too?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Just go.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

172
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:16,128
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

173
00:13:17,046 --> 00:13:18,297
<font color="white">My sincerest condolences.</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:13:19,048 --> 00:13:20,049
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:13:20,925 --> 00:13:21,800
<font color="white">Oh, yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:25,471
<font color="white">Earlier today, I met the gentleman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who is said to be your cousin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

177
00:13:26,347 --> 00:13:27,223
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:13:27,306 --> 00:13:30,351
<font color="white">I had long heard</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">much about him, of course.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

179
00:13:30,434 --> 00:13:33,521
<font color="white">But even at a glance,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">his beauty was striking enough</font><font color="white"></font></font>

180
00:13:33,604 --> 00:13:36,398
<font color="white">to make it plain he shares your blood.</font><font color="white"></font>

181
00:13:36,482 --> 00:13:38,734
<font color="white">You flatter us.</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:39,693 --> 00:13:40,528
<font color="white">Please.</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:14:20,025 --> 00:14:21,026
<font color="white">Young Master Geum-ho…</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:14:23,237 --> 00:14:26,240
<font color="white">Forgive me.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I still call him that out of habit.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

185
00:14:30,619 --> 00:14:32,329
<font color="white">This belonged to your late husband.</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:14:36,250 --> 00:14:41,130
<font color="white">He often came to read</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in our study annex while he was alive.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

187
00:14:41,755 --> 00:14:45,009
<font color="white">I believe this is a copy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">he transcribed himself then.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

188
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,595
<font color="white">Go on, open it.</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:14:57,479 --> 00:15:01,650
<font color="white">KWON GEUM-HO</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:15:10,576 --> 00:15:14,872
<font color="white">You can feel both his bold spirit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and steadfast character, can you not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

191
00:15:19,251 --> 00:15:20,377
<font color="white">Would you</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:15:20,878 --> 00:15:22,796
<font color="white">please tell me</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:15:23,839 --> 00:15:26,467
<font color="white">what sort of man he was?</font><font color="white"></font>

194
00:15:33,807 --> 00:15:35,184
<font color="white">He was</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:15:36,143 --> 00:15:38,854
<font color="white">truly a remarkable young man.</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:15:40,189 --> 00:15:43,400
<font color="white">Hardly a day passed without the sound</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of his reading drifting over the wall,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

197
00:15:43,901 --> 00:15:47,071
<font color="white">and the elders of his family</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">placed great hopes upon him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

198
00:15:48,238 --> 00:15:50,574
<font color="white">I heard he was unmatched</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">among countless scholars</font><font color="white"></font></font>

199
00:15:50,658 --> 00:15:53,035
<font color="white">even in the initial</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">civil service examination.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

200
00:15:55,496 --> 00:15:56,455
<font color="white">But</font><font color="white"></font>

201
00:15:57,831 --> 00:16:01,961
<font color="white">what I remember most is not any of that.</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:05,172
<font color="white">It is the gentle sight of him</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:16:05,881 --> 00:16:09,259
<font color="white">quietly catching</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a falling flower in his hand</font><font color="white"></font></font>

204
00:16:10,052 --> 00:16:12,137
<font color="white">and admiring it.</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:16:14,264 --> 00:16:17,184
<font color="white">He studied with eyes full of curiosity,</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:16:17,893 --> 00:16:22,439
<font color="white">always gazing warmly upon the world</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as it bloomed and faded</font><font color="white"></font></font>

207
00:16:24,108 --> 00:16:26,360
<font color="white">with each passing season.</font><font color="white"></font>

208
00:16:27,236 --> 00:16:28,904
<font color="white">That is what I remember.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:16:54,138 --> 00:16:55,848
<font color="white">-Wait.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Let us go. Quickly.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

210
00:16:55,931 --> 00:16:57,141
<font color="white">Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:16:57,224 --> 00:16:58,308
<font color="white">-Let us go.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Huh?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

212
00:16:59,018 --> 00:16:59,852
<font color="white">Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:17:00,894 --> 00:17:01,770
<font color="white">Bun-hui!</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:17:02,271 --> 00:17:03,147
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:17:04,690 --> 00:17:07,401
<font color="white">Look at you. How long has it been?</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:17:08,068 --> 00:17:08,902
<font color="white">Huh?</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:17:10,696 --> 00:17:11,905
<font color="white">Why the familiarity?</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:17:12,740 --> 00:17:15,409
<font color="white">Come now, I am only glad to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:17:18,787 --> 00:17:20,831
<font color="white">So, have you been well all this while?</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:17:20,914 --> 00:17:22,875
<font color="white">Well? Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:17:26,462 --> 00:17:27,337
<font color="white">I have lived</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:17:28,964 --> 00:17:30,758
<font color="white">all these years</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:17:31,842 --> 00:17:34,136
<font color="white">unable to forget the scent</font><font color="white"></font>

224
00:17:34,678 --> 00:17:36,513
<font color="white">you once drenched me in.</font><font color="white"></font>

225
00:17:38,515 --> 00:17:39,349
<font color="white">Step aside.</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:17:39,433 --> 00:17:41,185
<font color="white">Come now, Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:17:41,268 --> 00:17:42,603
<font color="white">You are here.</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:17:43,187 --> 00:17:44,605
<font color="white">Oh, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:17:44,688 --> 00:17:47,524
<font color="white">This is the mother of the lady</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who is to become Lord Yoo's concubine.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

230
00:17:48,192 --> 00:17:49,359
<font color="white">"My lord"?</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:17:49,985 --> 00:17:51,862
<font color="white">Wait, that means…</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:17:53,197 --> 00:17:55,699
<font color="white">My brother-in-law's concubine…</font><font color="white"></font>

233
00:17:56,325 --> 00:17:57,367
<font color="white">You are her mother?</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:17:57,993 --> 00:18:00,037
<font color="white">"Brother-in-law"?</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:18:02,790 --> 00:18:05,375
<font color="white">"Brother-in-law," you say?</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:18:05,459 --> 00:18:07,503
<font color="white">So then you are So-ok's mother…</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:18:08,587 --> 00:18:09,463
<font color="white">"Brother-in-law"?</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:18:11,006 --> 00:18:11,840
<font color="white">Wait…</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:18:18,222 --> 00:18:19,723
<font color="white">That wretched man.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:18:21,350 --> 00:18:22,601
<font color="white">He's driving me mad.</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:18:35,114 --> 00:18:36,490
<font color="white">She is</font><font color="white"></font>

242
00:18:37,991 --> 00:18:39,409
<font color="white">no ordinary girl, that one.</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:18:40,577 --> 00:18:41,411
<font color="white">Chil-seong!</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:18:41,495 --> 00:18:42,996
<font color="white">-Chil-seong!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

245
00:18:43,914 --> 00:18:46,917
<font color="white">Fan it harder!</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:18:47,000 --> 00:18:47,835
<font color="white">Oh, yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

247
00:18:51,046 --> 00:18:54,091
<font color="white">The meat melts in the mouth!</font><font color="white"></font>

248
00:18:55,050 --> 00:18:56,552
<font color="white">It sure does!</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:18:56,635 --> 00:18:58,053
<font color="white">How delicious!</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:18:58,137 --> 00:18:58,971
<font color="white">It's delicious!</font><font color="white"></font>

251
00:19:03,684 --> 00:19:05,102
<font color="white">Just wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

252
00:19:05,185 --> 00:19:06,854
<font color="white">The girl was mad for meat.</font><font color="white"></font>

253
00:19:07,771 --> 00:19:08,772
<font color="white">She will come.</font><font color="white"></font>

254
00:19:31,461 --> 00:19:34,381
<font color="white">Surely she will come before the sun sets.</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:19:42,931 --> 00:19:43,849
<font color="white">Could I…</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:19:48,187 --> 00:19:49,521
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

257
00:19:53,692 --> 00:19:54,568
<font color="white">Let me.</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:20:00,199 --> 00:20:01,992
<font color="white">Give it here. Careful now.</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:04,745
<font color="white">Water.</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:11,835
<font color="white">Wash it down as you eat.</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:20:13,670 --> 00:20:16,256
<font color="white">I won't take it from you.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I only fear you might choke.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

262
00:20:25,015 --> 00:20:28,602
<font color="white">But why are you letting me eat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such fine meat?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

263
00:20:28,685 --> 00:20:30,854
<font color="white">I may be a lowly servant,</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:20:30,938 --> 00:20:33,690
<font color="white">but even I know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">nothing in this world is free.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

265
00:20:34,274 --> 00:20:37,110
<font color="white">Did she read the letter at once?</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:20:38,862 --> 00:20:39,821
<font color="white">The letter?</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:20:40,656 --> 00:20:42,991
<font color="white">I have it safely right here.</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:20:43,742 --> 00:20:46,370
<font color="white">Wait, why would you…</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:20:46,954 --> 00:20:48,956
<font color="white">Hey, was it not meant for me?</font><font color="white"></font>

270
00:20:50,749 --> 00:20:53,126
<font color="white">Oh, dear. The meat is burning.</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:20:53,210 --> 00:20:55,754
<font color="white">I… I will go get it.</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:20:57,631 --> 00:21:00,259
<font color="white">Such fine meat! Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:21:01,760 --> 00:21:02,636
<font color="white">So,</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:21:03,136 --> 00:21:05,138
<font color="white">how much longer until the mourning ends?</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:21:05,722 --> 00:21:07,099
<font color="white">About a fortnight.</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:21:07,975 --> 00:21:11,436
<font color="white">Once that passes, it will all be over.</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:21:11,520 --> 00:21:13,772
<font color="white">My, this looks delicious.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:21:13,855 --> 00:21:15,732
<font color="white">But isn't that a good thing if it ends?</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:18,735
<font color="white">Your lady can't even eat good food</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">during mourning.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

280
00:21:18,819 --> 00:21:20,529
<font color="white">Have you never heard of a virtuous woman?</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:21:21,154 --> 00:21:23,198
<font color="white">-No.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-She ought to follow her husband in death.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

282
00:21:26,660 --> 00:21:27,911
<font color="white">You know nothing.</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:21:32,165 --> 00:21:33,750
<font color="white">I did not know.</font><font color="white"></font>

284
00:21:50,851 --> 00:21:52,060
<font color="white">Watch carefully.</font><font color="white"></font>

285
00:21:53,020 --> 00:21:55,522
<font color="white">I shall teach you each step.</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:21:56,857 --> 00:21:57,691
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:21:57,774 --> 00:22:00,110
<font color="white">Two more baskets are coming, sister.</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:22:00,193 --> 00:22:01,862
<font color="white">All right, hurry them over.</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:22:16,918 --> 00:22:18,170
<font color="white">Are you occupied?</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:22:18,670 --> 00:22:20,630
<font color="white">There is no end to what must be taught</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:22:20,714 --> 00:22:22,716
<font color="white">to one joining the household.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:25,344
<font color="white">Oh, this is the girl</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who is to be taken in as a concubine.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

293
00:22:25,927 --> 00:22:27,054
<font color="white">Her name is So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:22:29,306 --> 00:22:31,892
<font color="white">Greetings, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

295
00:22:33,393 --> 00:22:34,561
<font color="white">Pleased to meet you.</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:22:42,194 --> 00:22:44,654
<font color="white">I hear you paid a visit to that widow.</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:22:49,201 --> 00:22:51,453
<font color="white">Did you speak ill of me or something?</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:22:51,536 --> 00:22:54,372
<font color="white">In our library, I just happened to find</font><font color="white"></font>

299
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:59,002
<font color="white">a notebook once used by her late husband,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Young Master Geum-ho.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

300
00:23:00,128 --> 00:23:02,255
<font color="white">I went to deliver it</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:23:02,339 --> 00:23:05,092
<font color="white">and had a nice little chat with her.</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:23:06,927 --> 00:23:07,844
<font color="white">You happened to find</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:23:09,262 --> 00:23:10,430
<font color="white">his notebook, did you?</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:23:10,514 --> 00:23:15,310
<font color="white">She begged me to tell her</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">all there was to know of her husband.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

305
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:18,980
<font color="white">After I shared what I could remember,</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:23:19,064 --> 00:23:23,902
<font color="white">she gazed upon that notebook</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with such admiration.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

307
00:23:25,445 --> 00:23:26,863
<font color="white">I wish</font><font color="white"></font>

308
00:23:27,614 --> 00:23:30,242
<font color="white">you had been there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to see the look in her eyes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

309
00:23:31,284 --> 00:23:32,661
<font color="white">To imagine her</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:23:32,744 --> 00:23:36,581
<font color="white">looking upon me with those same eyes,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">begging for my love…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

311
00:23:38,125 --> 00:23:42,087
<font color="white">I dare say my dreams tonight</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">shall be sweet and exciting.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

312
00:23:44,923 --> 00:23:48,260
<font color="white">Since you are so full of confidence,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I suppose I need not worry.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

313
00:23:48,969 --> 00:23:52,931
<font color="white">But first, you will need</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to thoroughly erase the husband</font><font color="white"></font></font>

314
00:23:53,515 --> 00:23:56,226
<font color="white">who still occupies that widow's mind.</font><font color="white"></font>

315
00:23:56,309 --> 00:23:58,770
<font color="white">It is no matter, for the man is a ghost.</font><font color="white"></font>

316
00:23:59,271 --> 00:24:01,940
<font color="white">Can such a thing rival</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a flesh-and-blood man</font><font color="white"></font></font>

317
00:24:02,023 --> 00:24:04,151
<font color="white">rooted firmly in this world?</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:24:04,818 --> 00:24:07,404
<font color="white">She longs for him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">only because she never saw him.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

319
00:24:07,487 --> 00:24:10,699
<font color="white">Once she faces a real man,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she would be quick to fall into his arms.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

320
00:24:11,616 --> 00:24:12,659
<font color="white">And you believe</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:24:13,785 --> 00:24:17,831
<font color="white">that alone will suddenly</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">give her the courage to withstand</font><font color="white"></font></font>

322
00:24:18,957 --> 00:24:20,917
<font color="white">the countless eyes and ears of Bukchon?</font><font color="white"></font>

323
00:24:23,795 --> 00:24:26,339
<font color="white">When one comes to love</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with all one's being…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

324
00:24:29,342 --> 00:24:31,803
<font color="white">such obstacles become meaningless.</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:24:33,180 --> 00:24:34,389
<font color="white">Surely</font><font color="white"></font>

326
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:37,309
<font color="white">you know that as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:24:42,564 --> 00:24:43,440
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

328
00:24:45,650 --> 00:24:47,277
<font color="white">can be such a man.</font><font color="white"></font>

329
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:48,278
<font color="white">And I shall gladly</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:24:50,113 --> 00:24:52,324
<font color="white">be such a man for that lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

331
00:24:55,619 --> 00:24:56,536
<font color="white">Now,</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:24:57,787 --> 00:24:59,122
<font color="white">the ghost's name is</font><font color="white"></font>

333
00:24:59,956 --> 00:25:01,374
<font color="white">Geum-ho, is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:25:03,335 --> 00:25:04,252
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:25:09,382 --> 00:25:12,219
<font color="white">Visitors have arrived</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the Left State Councilor's house.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

336
00:25:36,368 --> 00:25:38,370
<font color="white">My lady, do you remember me?</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:25:39,120 --> 00:25:42,290
<font color="white">I am In-ho, who went to study</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">among the Confucian scholars of Andong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

338
00:25:43,625 --> 00:25:45,710
<font color="white">Why, can that young boy</font><font color="white"></font>

339
00:25:45,794 --> 00:25:48,088
<font color="white">truly have grown so much?</font><font color="white"></font>

340
00:25:49,881 --> 00:25:51,007
<font color="white">Have you been well?</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:25:57,430 --> 00:25:58,515
<font color="white">How do you do?</font><font color="white"></font>

342
00:25:58,598 --> 00:26:00,892
<font color="white">I am the youngest son</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the Left State Councilor,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

343
00:26:00,976 --> 00:26:02,310
<font color="white">Kwon In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:26:02,394 --> 00:26:04,646
<font color="white">I am brother-in-law to Minister Yoo,</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:26:05,313 --> 00:26:06,606
<font color="white">Cho Won.</font><font color="white"></font>

346
00:26:08,566 --> 00:26:09,401
<font color="white">Might you be</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:26:09,985 --> 00:26:12,904
<font color="white">the Scholar Cho Won,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">whose essay on the southern sacred herb</font><font color="white"></font></font>

348
00:26:13,905 --> 00:26:15,448
<font color="white">at the civil service examination</font><font color="white"></font>

349
00:26:16,032 --> 00:26:17,450
<font color="white">won such renown back then?</font><font color="white"></font>

350
00:26:17,534 --> 00:26:19,786
<font color="white">You flatter me with talk of renown.</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:26:19,869 --> 00:26:22,414
<font color="white">It was merely good fortune,</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:26:22,497 --> 00:26:24,457
<font color="white">thanks to a fine literary friend of mine.</font><font color="white"></font>

353
00:26:24,541 --> 00:26:25,917
<font color="white">It is an honor to meet you.</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:26:26,418 --> 00:26:29,546
<font color="white">Not only I,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but even the friends with whom I study,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

355
00:26:29,629 --> 00:26:31,256
<font color="white">have long wished to read your writings.</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:26:31,339 --> 00:26:34,175
<font color="white">We have a volume of his scholarly writings</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the study annex.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

357
00:26:34,926 --> 00:26:36,219
<font color="white">Why don't you two scholars</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:26:36,303 --> 00:26:40,432
<font color="white">look through it together</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and have a thoughtful discussion?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

359
00:26:42,183 --> 00:26:43,101
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

360
00:26:44,019 --> 00:26:45,854
<font color="white">Come with me, my lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

361
00:26:46,521 --> 00:26:50,650
<font color="white">Let us women share</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">some trivial secrets in the meantime.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

362
00:26:51,234 --> 00:26:52,068
<font color="white">Let me.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:27:01,786 --> 00:27:02,996
<font color="white">Shall we?</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:27:10,962 --> 00:27:14,174
<font color="white">My mother-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">wished to repay you for finding</font><font color="white"></font></font>

365
00:27:14,758 --> 00:27:16,384
<font color="white">my husband's belongings.</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:27:16,968 --> 00:27:18,762
<font color="white">She had meant to come herself,</font><font color="white"></font>

367
00:27:20,305 --> 00:27:22,474
<font color="white">but I told her I wished to see you</font><font color="white"></font>

368
00:27:23,224 --> 00:27:24,976
<font color="white">and asked if I could come in her stead.</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:27:25,560 --> 00:27:29,314
<font color="white">I only hope this sudden visit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has not been discourteous.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

370
00:27:29,397 --> 00:27:31,858
<font color="white">I could only be grateful.</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:27:33,318 --> 00:27:36,988
<font color="white">In truth, I have been</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">quite eager to see you myself.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

372
00:27:39,908 --> 00:27:41,159
<font color="white">How sweet of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:27:46,748 --> 00:27:47,791
<font color="white">It is exactly the same.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:27:48,375 --> 00:27:49,334
<font color="white">Just as I remember it.</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:27:49,417 --> 00:27:51,002
<font color="white">Did you visit often?</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:27:52,712 --> 00:27:54,506
<font color="white">I used to come here with my elder brother.</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:27:55,799 --> 00:27:57,384
<font color="white">They have every book imaginable.</font><font color="white"></font>

378
00:27:59,302 --> 00:28:00,220
<font color="white">In fact,</font><font color="white"></font>

379
00:28:00,303 --> 00:28:04,599
<font color="white">it was my brother</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who first told me of you, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

380
00:28:07,477 --> 00:28:08,436
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

381
00:28:08,520 --> 00:28:12,315
<font color="white">He said, "Within his writings lie</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">not only the truths of learning,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

382
00:28:12,399 --> 00:28:15,026
<font color="white">but also the joys and sorrows of life."</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:28:15,652 --> 00:28:18,696
<font color="white">Sadly, before I, with my shallow learning,</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:28:19,364 --> 00:28:21,616
<font color="white">could fully understand what he meant…</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:28:24,411 --> 00:28:26,955
<font color="white">The peonies have bloomed beautifully,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">have they not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

386
00:28:28,498 --> 00:28:30,750
<font color="white">Yes, indeed. They are quite lovely.</font><font color="white"></font>

387
00:28:30,834 --> 00:28:32,752
<font color="white">My husband's new concubine</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:28:33,795 --> 00:28:35,171
<font color="white">is very much like them.</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:28:37,048 --> 00:28:39,426
<font color="white">Look, Mal-ttong! There are flowers here!</font><font color="white"></font>

390
00:28:39,509 --> 00:28:41,302
<font color="white">Such a lovely girl.</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:28:42,220 --> 00:28:43,388
<font color="white">Careful, Miss!</font><font color="white"></font>

392
00:28:43,471 --> 00:28:45,056
<font color="white">Just like a peony,</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:28:45,724 --> 00:28:47,642
<font color="white">she carries a rosy smile</font><font color="white"></font>

394
00:28:48,226 --> 00:28:52,397
<font color="white">and fills every corner of this house</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with the fragrance of flowers.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

395
00:28:58,737 --> 00:29:01,239
<font color="white">What of your younger days?</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:29:01,322 --> 00:29:03,992
<font color="white">You too must have been so very beautiful.</font><font color="white"></font>

397
00:29:11,291 --> 00:29:13,460
<font color="white">I thought having a husband and serving him</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:29:13,543 --> 00:29:15,462
<font color="white">would be the joy of the rest of my life.</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:29:19,591 --> 00:29:21,092
<font color="white">Once my marriage was arranged,</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:29:22,385 --> 00:29:25,638
<font color="white">my heart began to flutter,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as if I had finally become a grown woman.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

401
00:29:30,560 --> 00:29:32,103
<font color="white">You asked earlier</font><font color="white"></font>

402
00:29:32,854 --> 00:29:35,440
<font color="white">why I wrote such an answer</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the palace examination.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

403
00:29:36,858 --> 00:29:37,692
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

404
00:29:38,443 --> 00:29:40,612
<font color="white">your brother saw straight through it.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:29:42,864 --> 00:29:44,073
<font color="white">At the time…</font><font color="white"></font>

406
00:29:46,785 --> 00:29:50,705
<font color="white">I was burdened with</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">more than a man of my age ought to bear.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

407
00:29:50,789 --> 00:29:53,291
<font color="white">There was once a man I loved.</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:29:55,043 --> 00:29:57,837
<font color="white">But ours was a bond</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">meant to be fulfilled only in death.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

409
00:29:58,338 --> 00:30:00,548
<font color="white">Joy, anger, sorrow, delight.</font><font color="white"></font>

410
00:30:01,758 --> 00:30:04,010
<font color="white">I lived through them all indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:30:05,637 --> 00:30:09,682
<font color="white">And so I poured every feeling</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">life had stirred in me into that essay.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

412
00:30:09,766 --> 00:30:11,476
<font color="white">Yet whenever I feel lonely,</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:30:13,186 --> 00:30:15,271
<font color="white">I find myself thinking of him.</font><font color="white"></font>

414
00:30:15,855 --> 00:30:17,023
<font color="white">It feels as though</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:30:18,274 --> 00:30:21,027
<font color="white">he might come rushing in</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and open my door at any moment</font><font color="white"></font></font>

416
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:23,321
<font color="white">if only I said I missed him.</font><font color="white"></font>

417
00:30:36,793 --> 00:30:38,169
<font color="white">I wish to entrust</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:30:39,087 --> 00:30:40,547
<font color="white">this secret of mine to this petal</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:30:40,630 --> 00:30:42,882
<font color="white">and offer it to you</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as a token of friendship.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

420
00:30:44,384 --> 00:30:47,512
<font color="white">Should you ever find yourself</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in need of help, come to me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

421
00:30:48,638 --> 00:30:49,556
<font color="white">And next time,</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:30:50,431 --> 00:30:53,476
<font color="white">I hope you will share</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your own heart with me as well.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

423
00:31:20,712 --> 00:31:24,299
<font color="white">You will not find anyone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">more tight-lipped than me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

424
00:31:28,553 --> 00:31:29,596
<font color="white">The truth is…</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:31:34,809 --> 00:31:38,771
<font color="white">Oh, my goodness!</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:31:46,279 --> 00:31:48,781
<font color="white">Until now, I thought</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pheasant was the finest thing there was,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

427
00:31:48,865 --> 00:31:51,034
<font color="white">but now my mind has changed completely.</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:31:53,036 --> 00:31:54,829
<font color="white">Right? Beef is the best, huh?</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:59,792
<font color="white">Pheasant does not even come close.</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:32:04,213 --> 00:32:06,132
<font color="white">I do not know what is written here…</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:32:10,929 --> 00:32:13,014
<font color="white">but these letters are truly beautiful.</font><font color="white"></font>

432
00:32:14,891 --> 00:32:15,767
<font color="white">Especially</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:32:17,685 --> 00:32:18,645
<font color="white">this one.</font><font color="white"></font>

434
00:32:19,812 --> 00:32:20,730
<font color="white">Is it?</font><font color="white"></font>

435
00:32:25,109 --> 00:32:26,653
<font color="white">I hope it's a son.</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:32:30,073 --> 00:32:31,199
<font color="white">Then I shall have him</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:32:32,200 --> 00:32:33,576
<font color="white">learn his letters too.</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:32:38,539 --> 00:32:40,667
<font color="white">This is called an alarm clock.</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:32:40,750 --> 00:32:43,419
<font color="white">My father brought it back</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">from the Great State.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

440
00:32:43,503 --> 00:32:45,964
<font color="white">What? Come on, it is not even food.</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:32:46,631 --> 00:32:48,132
<font color="white">-What is it for?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-You.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

442
00:32:48,716 --> 00:32:51,135
<font color="white">I told you to mind your tone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with me, did I not?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

443
00:32:51,219 --> 00:32:52,720
<font color="white">What is it for, miss?</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:32:55,473 --> 00:32:57,725
<font color="white">It tells the time.</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:32:58,518 --> 00:33:00,144
<font color="white">These needle-like things</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:33:00,228 --> 00:33:03,982
<font color="white">go round and round all day long</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and show the time.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

447
00:33:04,565 --> 00:33:06,401
<font color="white">-What?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It is a rare treasure</font><font color="white"></font></font>

448
00:33:06,484 --> 00:33:08,736
<font color="white">you would go your whole lives</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">without ever laying eyes on</font><font color="white"></font></font>

449
00:33:08,820 --> 00:33:10,488
<font color="white">if it weren't for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:33:10,571 --> 00:33:12,073
<font color="white">Thanks to me, you get to see one.</font><font color="white"></font>

451
00:33:12,156 --> 00:33:13,116
<font color="white">Nice, is it not?</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:33:14,450 --> 00:33:15,535
<font color="white">Hey, where are you going?</font><font color="white"></font>

453
00:33:15,618 --> 00:33:16,703
<font color="white">I'm not finished…</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:33:20,498 --> 00:33:22,291
<font color="white">What are you doing here?</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:33:22,917 --> 00:33:24,002
<font color="white">Well, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:33:25,712 --> 00:33:27,714
<font color="white">Goodness,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">this is a most precious treasure.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

457
00:33:27,797 --> 00:33:29,674
<font color="white">How could you handle it so carelessly?</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:33:31,384 --> 00:33:33,011
<font color="white">Is that an alarm clock?</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:33:33,678 --> 00:33:34,929
<font color="white">I've only read of it in books.</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:37,265
<font color="white">This is my first time seeing one.</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:33:37,348 --> 00:33:40,143
<font color="white">Truly, there is nothing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Lord Yoo's house doesn't possess.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

462
00:33:46,315 --> 00:33:47,525
<font color="white">If you</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:33:49,068 --> 00:33:50,153
<font color="white">turn it like this…</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:34:02,832 --> 00:34:03,875
<font color="white">Hey!</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:34:10,882 --> 00:34:12,759
<font color="white">I thought heaven and earth</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">were splitting apart.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

466
00:34:13,384 --> 00:34:14,719
<font color="white">How can it make such a noise?</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:34:16,262 --> 00:34:17,263
<font color="white">Please come along now.</font><font color="white"></font>

468
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:30,485
<font color="white">My apologies.</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:34:37,283 --> 00:34:38,117
<font color="white">That way.</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:35:08,439 --> 00:35:10,817
<font color="white">I just saw your palanquin leaving.</font><font color="white"></font>

471
00:35:11,984 --> 00:35:13,069
<font color="white">Who was inside?</font><font color="white"></font>

472
00:35:17,240 --> 00:35:18,282
<font color="white">Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

473
00:35:18,866 --> 00:35:20,076
<font color="white">That day…</font><font color="white"></font>

474
00:35:21,536 --> 00:35:23,287
<font color="white">The day you would have</font><font color="white"></font>

475
00:35:24,747 --> 00:35:27,250
<font color="white">waited endlessly for me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the ferry landing.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

476
00:35:30,878 --> 00:35:32,964
<font color="white">I can only imagine how much pain…</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:35:36,384 --> 00:35:37,760
<font color="white">you must have been in that day.</font><font color="white"></font>

478
00:35:59,532 --> 00:36:00,783
<font color="white">And what of you that day?</font><font color="white"></font>

479
00:36:14,422 --> 00:36:16,591
<font color="white">Hurry and follow the palanquin.</font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:36:17,967 --> 00:36:20,595
<font color="white">The one inside</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">may prove most beneficial to you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

481
00:36:24,307 --> 00:36:25,975
<font color="white">Do you speak of the widow?</font><font color="white"></font>

482
00:36:31,397 --> 00:36:33,357
<font color="white">Are you helping me…</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:36:40,072 --> 00:36:42,241
<font color="white">out of remorse for the past?</font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:36:44,535 --> 00:36:47,413
<font color="white">Let us say I simply feel too lonely today.</font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:36:48,623 --> 00:36:49,624
<font color="white">Now, go.</font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:36:50,374 --> 00:36:51,792
<font color="white">Before you lose her.</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:56,172
<font color="white">The more I know you…</font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:37:04,305 --> 00:37:06,140
<font color="white">the more unknowable you seem.</font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:37:24,492 --> 00:37:25,952
<font color="white">A marriage proposal sent for you.</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:37:27,745 --> 00:37:30,081
<font color="white">It is from Yoo Hong-sang,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a junior academic official.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

491
00:37:31,540 --> 00:37:32,959
<font color="white">Now, this family</font><font color="white"></font>

492
00:37:33,542 --> 00:37:36,087
<font color="white">would not scold a woman</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for being bold enough</font><font color="white"></font></font>

493
00:37:36,170 --> 00:37:37,922
<font color="white">to read proper script.</font><font color="white"></font>

494
00:37:38,005 --> 00:37:40,258
<font color="white">They are men</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with the confidence and generosity</font><font color="white"></font></font>

495
00:37:40,800 --> 00:37:43,010
<font color="white">to exchange and recite verses</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with their wives,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

496
00:37:43,719 --> 00:37:45,346
<font color="white">and live out their days</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:37:45,888 --> 00:37:48,224
<font color="white">in perfect harmony.</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:38:08,077 --> 00:38:09,412
<font color="white">MUN-HEUL</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:38:09,495 --> 00:38:10,997
<font color="white">Take it.</font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:38:11,080 --> 00:38:12,123
<font color="white">What do you mean to do?</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:38:12,206 --> 00:38:14,125
<font color="white">-I am leaving tomorrow.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Miss Yun!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

502
00:38:14,208 --> 00:38:15,918
<font color="white">That is why you must deliver it.</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:38:16,002 --> 00:38:18,129
<font color="white">So we do not pass each other by. Please?</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:38:43,654 --> 00:38:44,488
<font color="white"><i>Won,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:38:44,989 --> 00:38:48,701
<font color="white"><i>perhaps I am a woman</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>who longs for love after all.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:38:49,702 --> 00:38:52,204
<font color="white"><i>Even now,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>as marriage talks pass between families,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:38:53,122 --> 00:38:55,499
<font color="white"><i>my eyes, my hands,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:38:56,208 --> 00:38:58,919
<font color="white"><i>and my heart search only for you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:39:00,796 --> 00:39:02,173
<font color="white"><i>So I ask this of you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:39:03,132 --> 00:39:05,384
<font color="white"><i>Where my sorrowful tears have pooled,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:39:05,926 --> 00:39:07,803
<font color="white"><i>I shall ready a lonely boat.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:39:08,387 --> 00:39:10,389
<font color="white"><i>Will you please wait for me there?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:39:11,599 --> 00:39:14,143
<font color="white"><i>I will come to you.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:39:41,170 --> 00:39:42,213
<font color="white">Father.</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:39:44,215 --> 00:39:45,466
<font color="white">Oh, Yun.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:39:46,133 --> 00:39:47,843
<font color="white">What brings you out at this hour?</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:39:49,678 --> 00:39:52,723
<font color="white">Father, may I ask why you are in tears?</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:39:58,521 --> 00:40:00,064
<font color="white">Because it is such a waste.</font><font color="white"></font>

519
00:40:01,315 --> 00:40:05,152
<font color="white">Had you been born a man, you'd have taken</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">top honors in the civil service exam.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

520
00:40:07,655 --> 00:40:09,448
<font color="white">If only you were not a woman…</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:40:13,786 --> 00:40:16,539
<font color="white">you would have had many chances</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to make your name known.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

522
00:40:18,374 --> 00:40:21,710
<font color="white">But now that even your marriage</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has been arranged,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

523
00:40:22,920 --> 00:40:24,046
<font color="white">how many more times</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:40:25,840 --> 00:40:28,676
<font color="white">shall I see your face before I die?</font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:41:58,766 --> 00:42:01,227
<font color="white">Let us proceed with the bowing.</font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:42:07,358 --> 00:42:09,527
<font color="white">The groom shall answer with one bow.</font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:42:20,746 --> 00:42:23,415
<font color="white">Now, the wedding vows.</font><font color="white"></font>

528
00:42:51,026 --> 00:42:53,279
<font color="white">My dear Kkot-bun! Come here!</font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:42:54,238 --> 00:42:56,407
<font color="white">-Come here, you!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Come here.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

530
00:42:57,658 --> 00:42:59,577
<font color="white">Over here!</font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:43:04,873 --> 00:43:05,916
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:43:06,792 --> 00:43:08,168
<font color="white">Do you remember me?</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:43:10,170 --> 00:43:11,505
<font color="white">I did not recognize you.</font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:43:11,589 --> 00:43:13,924
<font color="white">-Missus!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Your garments are ready, sir.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

535
00:43:14,008 --> 00:43:14,883
<font color="white">Missus!</font><font color="white"></font>

536
00:43:16,552 --> 00:43:17,386
<font color="white">Missus.</font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:43:22,474 --> 00:43:23,934
<font color="white">Mend my garment for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:43:27,229 --> 00:43:28,063
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:43:40,826 --> 00:43:42,703
<font color="white">All right, this arm first.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:43:44,830 --> 00:43:45,664
<font color="white">Oh, dear.</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:43:48,751 --> 00:43:51,003
<font color="white">Forgive my carelessness, young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:43:51,086 --> 00:43:53,047
<font color="white">I shall alter it to fit you properly.</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:43:55,215 --> 00:43:57,343
<font color="white">I must have been mistaken.</font><font color="white"></font>

544
00:43:58,135 --> 00:44:00,179
<font color="white">No, the fault is not yours.</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:44:00,763 --> 00:44:02,514
<font color="white">I simply have grown since then.</font><font color="white"></font>

546
00:44:03,807 --> 00:44:04,642
<font color="white">Young master.</font><font color="white"></font>

547
00:44:06,685 --> 00:44:09,146
<font color="white">If I may ask, why were you</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:44:09,229 --> 00:44:11,649
<font color="white">standing by the river</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with such sorrowful eyes?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

549
00:44:13,734 --> 00:44:15,486
<font color="white">What makes you say so?</font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:44:20,699 --> 00:44:22,409
<font color="white">The traces of your tears</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:44:22,993 --> 00:44:24,536
<font color="white">were still glistening.</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:44:26,580 --> 00:44:27,998
<font color="white">The woman I love</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:44:29,375 --> 00:44:30,626
<font color="white">has left me.</font><font color="white"></font>

554
00:44:33,962 --> 00:44:35,047
<font color="white">Sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:44:35,631 --> 00:44:38,509
<font color="white">Tears will not bring her back.</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:44:40,302 --> 00:44:41,303
<font color="white">Do you still see</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:44:43,138 --> 00:44:45,849
<font color="white">traces of tears upon my face?</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:44:48,727 --> 00:44:50,020
<font color="white">Missus!</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:44:54,233 --> 00:44:55,526
<font color="white">Missus!</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:44:56,652 --> 00:44:57,736
<font color="white">Hand me the mirror.</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:44:57,820 --> 00:44:59,363
<font color="white">Is my garment done yet?</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:45:11,542 --> 00:45:14,336
<font color="white">Missus, do you have any tobacco left?</font><font color="white"></font>

563
00:45:14,920 --> 00:45:16,255
<font color="white">How impatient you are!</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:46:01,717 --> 00:46:02,593
<font color="white">Cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:46:11,768 --> 00:46:13,520
<font color="white">Would you look at this gentleman?</font><font color="white"></font>

566
00:46:14,563 --> 00:46:15,481
<font color="white">That tickles!</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:46:23,322 --> 00:46:24,156
<font color="white">How…</font><font color="white"></font>

568
00:46:25,491 --> 00:46:26,700
<font color="white">How are you</font><font color="white"></font>

569
00:46:27,993 --> 00:46:29,953
<font color="white">so beautiful?</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:47:29,555 --> 00:47:31,640
<font color="white">Wait! Wait just a moment!</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:47:32,391 --> 00:47:34,518
<font color="white">Why are you in such haste?</font><font color="white"></font>

572
00:51:04,311 --> 00:51:09,316
<font color="white">Subtitle translation by: Yoonjung Song</font><font color="white"></font>

